sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Developer / reviewer
  participant S as Orchestrator or<br/>SABLE API
  participant A as SABLE analyzer<br/>(sable/analyzer.py)
  participant K as Threat repository<br/>(sable_rules)
  participant H as HCL parser<br/>(hcl_parser.py)
  participant E as Policy semantics<br/>(policy_semantics.py)
  participant CO as Correspondence<br/>(correspondence.py)
  participant G as Evidence + final gate

  R->>S: run with baseline + candidate Terraform
  S->>A: analyze(context)
  A->>K: load SABLE rules
  alt rules missing or disabled
    A-->>S: UNKNOWN
  else rules present
    A->>H: parse baseline/infra and candidate/infra
    H-->>A: resources, references, moves, parse errors
    A->>E: does the baseline satisfy the obligation?
    alt baseline missing, not parsed or not holding
      A-->>S: UNKNOWN (unverified baseline)
    else baseline verified
      A->>CO: rank successor candidates of the protected asset
      CO-->>A: hypotheses + conflicts, choose (score, margin)
      alt no unique successor or principal unresolved
        A-->>S: UNKNOWN
      else successor chosen
        A->>E: evaluate obligation on the successor
        E-->>A: known? holds?
        A-->>S: PRESERVED / REGRESSED (UNKNOWN if not known)
      end
    end
  end
  S->>G: store evidence (candidate snapshot, input hash)
  G-->>R: module result + shared gate decision
